	(text "Two IM03GR relays, as on the\nMES2_Extension: PA0 → CLK,\nPA1 → ACLK (AO3400A drivers).\nContacts switch the 48 V winch\ncontroller's direction inputs.\nHardware interlock: both on =\nboth open."
