	(text "E-Crawler carrier for one MES4-MCU module (MES4-CIF rev A-d6). Circuits taken from the MES4-Flasher: PC817 sensor inputs,\nADS1232 load cell, relay channels (driver, INA226) and the XT30 / URB2405S 24 V input.\nGPIO budget: 4 relay drives + ALERT + 3 ADS1232 + 2 sensors + winch (2) + servo USART2 (2) = 14.\nDiffers from the MES4-CIF §2c table: no relay coil feedback, so PA0-PA3 drive the winch and the servo UART.\nRelay drive per CIF §7a (AO3400A, 100 Ω, 100k pull-down); the Flasher uses a 2SC2884 BJT for the same job.\nNo hot-plug: unplug the 24 V XT30 before inserting or removing the module.\nPages: Main (2), CAN (3), Power (4), Relays 1-2 (5), Relays 3-4 (6), Sensors (7), LoadCell (8), AuxPower (9), Winch (10), Pinout (11)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 221 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "c43af918-4245-5081-85d3-3f7c8192ca1b")
	)
